Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:33.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:36.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:39.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:43.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:57.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:03:00.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:11.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:14.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:24.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:30.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:37.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:42.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:46.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:47.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:48.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:51.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:24.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算隱瞞也是沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼我都全部知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:35.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這並非不可思議　因為　我是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:40.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛著你的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:45.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　朝向這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:49.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:51.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:56.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直　永遠不變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:23:03.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在珠穆朗瑪峰　向世界進行　絕對宣言！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:08.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之　接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:12.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,2人　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:14.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:19.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是　希望大吉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:23.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在聖·伯多祿　發誓　愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:26.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對宣言！！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們三個  已經到起床的時間…了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呆呆地看什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…大家起得都很真早呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可並不是期待著去上學的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.57,0:00:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小時候開始幼兒園和學校都沒去上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是  同年齡的孩子除了Children以外都不認識
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的孩子到底在思考些什麼  真的很期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個  還記得約定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長說之後會買喜歡的東西給我們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去海外旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要性感帥氣的勝負內衣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對！在那之前有要履行的約定吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:01:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道～在學校不使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論發生什麼衝突
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要用超能力之外的方法解決
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要說多少遍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  來約定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children上學計劃  進入第二階段了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了  柏木君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也開始行動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路線上有車輛接近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各單位進入警戒狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這輛車是市內的國有酒店的  沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是擁有超能力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動  一刀兩斷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上下上左下右左  右右下上上左  右右下右上左上  上下下右下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有  左上的膠布好像要掉下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個故事是將
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所屬於B.A.B.E.L的特殊超能力小隊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children的活躍與成長  可愛地描繪出來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(660,570)}6th sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(760,600)}「打架正合我意！在同班同學面前…！？」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.03,0:04:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是學校…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  因為家裡的情況而一起轉學到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是明石薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.97,0:04:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是野上葵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三宮紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三個人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡左邊那個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飾品  該不會是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇～有這麼多小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害  要把她們全部培養好肯定很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在想下流的東西吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  最後一排是你們的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三個人都很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我們的座位嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君  你的任務有兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個是她們的護衛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是為了這個而準備的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  為了這天而開發的特殊光學迷彩服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Optical Camouflage Jacket
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正確點說  這只是試驗品而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用光的反射特性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以使著裝者隱形的好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為還不知道超能力排斥團體「平凡人」\N會採取怎樣的妨害行動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木君  把那個給他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼是槍  而且還是兩把
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說明一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我來說明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這把槍裝填著強化了ESP抑制劑的麻醉彈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ESP抑制劑？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ESP限制器的中和量是LV3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LV7的Children她們  就算現在的狀態也可以使出LV4的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  這是為了對付她們的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的第二個任務是監視她們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是以備不時之需的措施
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也相信那些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬不要發生和模擬時一樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正  不管發生什麼我都打算全力抹滅的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Optical Camouflage  Switch ON
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我就去前往護衛和監視Children
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那三人去上小學的這個計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:07:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children就學計劃是國家的…不  關係著超能力者的未來！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  三個人是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼一起轉學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…因為工作相同的緣故
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父母的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.07,0:07:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  對
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來是已經打成一片了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是ESP限制器  對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三個人都是超能力者吧？對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸…呃…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是LV2的精神感應能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過LV2和普通人是差不多的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫花井千里  明石同學你們的能力是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是LV2的念動能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同等級的瞬間移動能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LV2的接觸感應能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼說話如此僵硬？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有掌握好角色嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班裡竟然有四個超能力者  真討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不許把限制器給解除啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  這可是自己不能解除的特製品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特製品？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早…早Kiss過了  嘻嘻的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做過了啊  Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎樣都不要給我用超能力  會帶來麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣  東野君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花井…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼  那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君討厭超能力者  平時總是像這樣對待花井同學的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  東野君他…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又想包庇他  超能力者有什麼不好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  那樣說的只有那個傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  有關超能力什麼的話題  剛才不說就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為迄今為止我周圍一直沒有同樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不由得  覺得很開心…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在意  我們明白你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差勁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  盡量搞好關係吧  醜女超能力者同志
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道  是薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做的吧  你這個念動力者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼誰都不在  黑板擦會飛過來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了你以外  誰做的到！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果讓對方受傷的話  可就一切全完了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一…一切都…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓這一切都白費嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是約好了絕對不使用超能力的嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是使用了嗎！騙子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那讓我看看證據
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那個必要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨你怎麼想  我已經和人約好絕對不使用超能力了\N而且那傢伙也相信著這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說  對你這樣的傢伙根本就沒必要使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是男子漢的話就用拳頭來解決
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  快回座位上去  打鈴了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:10:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君  鈴響了而已  幹嘛摔倒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭～男孩子真粗暴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼  那麼滑頭  那也算是超能力嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  明石同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  因為我的錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心  放心  別在意  別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才又想使用念動力了吧  虧你忍住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一瞬間  感覺看到了皆本那快要哭的臉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯  薰沒有使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那到底是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用黑板擦玩的時候要小心一點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為還不知道超能力排斥團體「平凡人」會採取怎樣的妨害行動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…難道說！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}よっ！東野将だ{\r}\N喲  我是東野將
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}だから　花井ちさとだよ{\r}\N所以說  我是花井千里啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下節體育課後  今天的課程就結束了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外地一點都不無聊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的體操服本來是普通的短褲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天起突然變成緊身短褲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸…欸～
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吧  是你做的手腳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你向局長拜託讓他改掉的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是大叔嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是妥協了的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來是想換成運動短褲的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在現今社會還…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是躲避球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼起勁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又想使用超能力了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過面對六條院小學的躲避球王本東野將大爺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不使用超能力你是沒有勝算的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不使用也能贏你的話呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛…那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就相信超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼「如果不使用超能力也能贏的話」  明擺著要使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者都是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別以為耍詐不被別人發現就沒事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是躲避球王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然能和薰打成平手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,體育課啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個  怎麼這麼認真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  東野君為什麼那麼討厭超能力者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君和我  從幼兒園開始就在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們家是鄰居  母親之間的關係也很好  所以到最近為止還經常玩在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不在意我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精…精神感應…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那邊有蚱蟬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:15:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使在超能力檢查中發現了超能力  但是千里還是千里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把我讀了東野君的心的事告訴了媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果  傳到了東野的耳朵裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  東野君  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒想到你是會做那樣事情的人！我要和你絕交！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那之後  一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓東野君原諒我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  可能已經不行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始才是真正的勝負了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我所願！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  結果還是變成這樣了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為性格相近？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳…動不了了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動力！你…你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道並不是她使用了超能力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:16:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,透明人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  那表情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想被你說！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那裡嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？一副已經到了極限的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說誰啊  我可是躲避球王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在用這個打倒你之前我是不會倒下的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真敢說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  今天的課就上到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勝…勝負就留到下次的體育課吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正…正如我所願
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Optical Camouflage的機能…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住！不會讓你逃的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花井
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君  那件事真是對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼早的事情  早就忘記了  千里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  是你呼叫我們嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在跳什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還在做奇怪的Cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼東西在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡可是學校  用超能力不要緊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是緊急事件
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children  解禁！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在哪裡呼喚著
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給予你懲罰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不做誰來做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回應你的期待  現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解禁！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別礙事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個沒收了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  這傢伙需要教訓一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic Destroy Shoot{\r}\N念動破壞力射門
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就應該想到試驗品不只一個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為…因為他…欺負我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是沒有辦法的事情嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要在這鬧脾氣  你要贖罪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你唱什麼歌啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:20:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是送來的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是局長給Children的三人的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面的東西沒有異常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊  都有了女朋友還和其他女孩子約會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口袋裡的戒指去送給女朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看啊  別讀心  對不起啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做了件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到真的給我們買了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是我們拜託的…但是真的沒關係嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰…誰知道呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏…柏木君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.43,0:21:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這份清單…後面的零太多了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那可是試驗品啊  Optical Camouflage Jacket
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我說過修理費我自己出…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能…能不能一半由經費來付啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  你要的是這個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  為了下次的勝負  要進行特訓了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特訓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能陪我的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  只是這種事的話  沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  現在就開始特訓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招  皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.85,0:23:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要進行ECM的測試就早點說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.71,0:23:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果事前就知道是ECM的測試的話  我們擔心得不到正確的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了ECM外你還隱瞞了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有ECM這事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  皆本  ECM是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.51,0:24:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第7話  「平平凡凡！被束縛的Children」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是作為普通人們的代表與你們鬥爭到底的「平凡人」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

